  "releaseNotes": "v10.2.0: Drains queued writers during transport abort and isolates sequential reconnect cleanup and disposal admission. Expands controlled tests for payload leases, parser retention, Close ordering and periodic Ping cleanup. Adds source/runtime-bound evidence and bounded diagnostic cleanup. Dafny proof scope is unchanged; asynchronous lifecycle behavior remains tested C# evidence. See README.md and docs/p3-g-validation.md.",
